{"_id":"7LjgwaI009oFW1SZ","folder":null,"img":"modules/pf2e-dungeon-crawl/assets/creature-art/gatewalkers-bestiary/the-guest.webp","items":[{"_id":"sJGD4KrnEDUPhooi","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Claw","sort":100000,"system":{"attack":{"value":""},"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"bonus":{"value":17},"damageRolls":{"iRohIYqj9vaNZwaZ":{"damage":"2d6 + 10","damageType":"slashing"},"t2z1I5ltJreoHELP":{"damage":"1d6","damageType":"cold"}},"description":{"value":""},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"range":null,"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["unarmed","versatile-b"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"melee","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!7LjgwaI009oFW1SZ.sJGD4KrnEDUPhooi"},{"_id":"mUdgb2Cqijvvw65Y","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Fall Apart","sort":200000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":true,"description":{"value":"<p>When one of the Guests dies, its body falls apart into a tangle of meat, gristle, fur, bone, and gore. All creatures within a @Template[emanation|distance:10] (other than other Guests) must make a @Check[will|dc:22] save to avoid becoming @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2} (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 4} on a critical failure) at the sight and smell of this fate.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["occult"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!7LjgwaI009oFW1SZ.mUdgb2Cqijvvw65Y"},{"_id":"YFKxEov4UIVw4Pto","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","name":"Frozen Wind","sort":300000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The guest exhales a blast of freezing wind from its body in a @Template[cone|distance:20]. All creatures in this area take @Damage[8d6[cold]|options:area-damage] (@Check[reflex|dc:25|basic|options:area-effect]). The Guest can't use Frozen Wind again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Frozen Wind]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!7LjgwaI009oFW1SZ.YFKxEov4UIVw4Pto"},{"_id":"hDpm7a2OXARGsF4P","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Stunning Critical","sort":400000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>If a Guest critically hits a creature with a claw Strike, the target must make a @Check[fortitude|dc:25] save or be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[{"key":"Note","outcome":["criticalSuccess"],"selector":"strike-damage","text":"{item|system.description.value}","title":"{item|name}","visibility":"owner"}],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!7LjgwaI009oFW1SZ.hDpm7a2OXARGsF4P"},{"_id":"q1j5oT9xOrRhtlbn","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/FreeAction.webp","name":"Trigger Memory","sort":500000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"free"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A gatewalker attempts to Strike a Guest or target a Guest with a spell</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The first time a gatewalker (including any PC) attempts to Strike a Guest or target it with a spell, a repressed memory from their Missing Moment surfaces. For a brief instant, the character recalls facing down a much larger and fully formed saumen kar, one with four horns and glowing runes on its fur. This memory of the character's first encounter with Ainamuuren evokes waves of fear and shame. The character must make a successful @Check[will|dc:25] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1} (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2} on a critical failure), after which the character is immune to Trigger Memory.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["emotion","fear","mental","occult"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!7LjgwaI009oFW1SZ.q1j5oT9xOrRhtlbn"}],"name":"The Guest","system":{"abilities":{"cha":{"mod":0},"con":{"mod":4},"dex":{"mod":3},"int":{"mod":-4},"str":{"mod":4},"wis":{"mod":2}},"attributes":{"ac":{"details":"","value":24},"allSaves":{"value":"+1 circumstance vs. diseases and poisons"},"hp":{"details":"","max":130,"temp":0,"value":130},"resistances":[{"doubleVs":[],"exceptions":[],"type":"bludgeoning","value":10},{"doubleVs":[],"exceptions":[],"type":"cold","value":10}],"speed":{"otherSpeeds":[],"value":25},"weaknesses":[{"exceptions":[],"type":"slashing","value":10}]},"details":{"blurb":"Fleshwarp","languages":{"details":"","value":[]},"level":{"value":7},"privateNotes":"","publicNotes":"","publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Adventure Path: Gatewalkers"}},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"perception":{"details":"","mod":15,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"}]},"resources":{},"saves":{"fortitude":{"saveDetail":"","value":17},"reflex":{"saveDetail":"","value":14},"will":{"saveDetail":"","value":13}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":14},"athletics":{"base":17}},"traits":{"rarity":"unique","size":{"value":"med"},"value":["aberration","humanoid"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"npc","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.gatewalkers-bestiary.Actor.FGOMsKi1Z0a7uJJy"},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors!7LjgwaI009oFW1SZ","prototypeToken":{"texture":{"src":"modules/pf2e-dungeon-crawl/assets/creature-art/gatewalkers-bestiary/the-guest.webp"}},"flags":{"pf2e-dungeon-crawl":{"artEntryId":"gatewalkers_bestiary__the_guest","sourcePack":"pf2e.gatewalkers-bestiary","sourceDocId":"FGOMsKi1Z0a7uJJy"}}}